  description="The terms for using rathkit.com and its docs: how the software licenses relate to these terms, how the Rathkit name may be used, and the limits on what the site promises."
>
  <article class="doc">
    <p class="eyebrow">Terms</p>
    <h1>Terms of use</h1>
